{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>What is Midnight Survivor?</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you, the Midnight Survivor who has endured countless days and nights, can rise as this world\u2019s savior and defend it from the approaching tide of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/4b8ee79ddc9f3508ef46c9611963f1f1.poster.avif?t=1764780056\" width=580 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/4b8ee79ddc9f3508ef46c9611963f1f1.webm?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/4b8ee79ddc9f3508ef46c9611963f1f1.mp4?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Strategic Defense</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and mine rocks to create turret points, then carry the logs and stones to the portal to convert them into resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict enemy routes, place various turrets and traps, and hold back massive waves of incoming foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ea9cc0b1c6be94bbc3fa94da9d6a6e81.poster.avif?t=1764780056\" width=580 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ea9cc0b1c6be94bbc3fa94da9d6a6e81.webm?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/ea9cc0b1c6be94bbc3fa94da9d6a6e81.mp4?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Overdrive Shot</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies fills your Overdrive Gauge. Once maxed, you can unleash a powerful burst of energy that deals massive area damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and Overdrive abilities through the tech tree and bring them into the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/92627c1841c36d1bdd030d2d4debf08b.poster.avif?t=1764780056\" width=580 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/92627c1841c36d1bdd030d2d4debf08b.webm?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/92627c1841c36d1bdd030d2d4debf08b.mp4?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Garden System</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow various crops and artifacts on your farm to boost your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your limited budget and farmland efficiently to maintain peak combat readiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/71f20cdf2bdc653c08e01dc59d5f9e37.poster.avif?t=1764780056\" width=576 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/71f20cdf2bdc653c08e01dc59d5f9e37.webm?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/71f20cdf2bdc653c08e01dc59d5f9e37.mp4?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Skill Collection</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave, choose a skill card to enhance your combat power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you clear a stage, one of the cards becomes permanently yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the next stage begins, select owned cards to activate their bonuses and face even stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/d3dbdd5bd3409a4b7b0219e583c55fed.poster.avif?t=1764780056\" width=580 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/d3dbdd5bd3409a4b7b0219e583c55fed.webm?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/extras/d3dbdd5bd3409a4b7b0219e583c55fed.mp4?t=1764780056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>And one last thing\u2026</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve ever slept at night and woken up in the morning,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>you are already a Midnight Survivor!!!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2195510?t=1764780056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2195510?t=1764780056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/2a50c94a10e237c93cb1929f2cdf9a512bb6267f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764780056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195510/2a50c94a10e237c93cb1929f2cdf9a512bb6267f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764780056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23